pace that contains $S,$ then Stokes' theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot dr={∬}_{S}\\text{curl}\\,F\\cdot \\text{d}S.\n$$\n\nAlong the curve $C,$ we have\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t),\\,y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t),\\,z=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t).\n$$\n\nSo,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t)) & =2y\\,i-2x\\,j+{e}^{z-2y}\\,k \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+{e}^{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)}\\,k \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t))\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t))\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t))\\,k \\\\  & =-\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i+\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) & =(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+k)\\cdot (-\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\,i+\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,j+2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\,k) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)\\cdot (-\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t))-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)\\cdot \\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t)+1\\cdot 2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t) \\\\  & =-2\\pi {sin}^{2}⁡(\\pi t)-2\\pi {cos}^{2}⁡(\\pi t)+2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t) \\\\  & =-2\\pi +2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\text{curl}\\,F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∮}_{C}F\\cdot dr \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}(-2\\pi +2\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t))\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =[-2\\pi t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)]_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =(-2\\pi (1)+0)-(-2\\pi (-1)+0) \\\\  & =-4\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371862 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371863 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371864 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371865 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371866 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1041 "selection" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1104 #edb/ref 17592186371862 13194139535875 true] [17592186371861 1110 #uuid "daa2ac0c-c077-54a3-b146-fbd270744bd4" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371862 1034 "-4\\pi " 13194139535875 true] [17592186371862 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535875 true] [17592186371862 1111 #uuid "6b98cb58-c9c7-5bbe-9dc7-c06d25ae7ba0" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371863 1034 "-\\pi " 13194139535875 true] [17592186371863 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535875 true] [17592186371863 1111 #uuid "6ffb8641-cad8-567b-8a7c-8619e85947cc" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371864 1034 "3\\pi " 13194139535875 true] [17592186371864 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535875 true] [17592186371864 1111 #uuid "3523c6a2-fdd6-5d05-8aa6-574aa8f39240" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371865 1034 "2\\pi " 13194139535875 true] [17592186371865 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535875 true] [17592186371865 1111 #uuid "400d3580-8833-5322-a660-4e267f74e126" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371866 1034 "0" 13194139535875 true] [17592186371866 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535875 true] [17592186371866 1111 #uuid "acff9520-6bb3-5ad8-af70-7f06439eeba8" 13194139535875 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-161927/selection/ma-v1/12c8fb407f88f1ba6d0ccb7aff1510da720f418d1392e79e016a1609156b1339" 17592186371770 "q-161927/selection/ma-v1/12c8fb407f88f1ba6d0ccb7aff1510da720f418d1392e79e016a1609156b1339/4c0732a440fcab2ab70d6dcbc8d1d5cc252d8289f521308d56dfc77253cae64b" 17592186371771 "q-161927/selection/ma-v1/12c8fb